    {
      "id": "72516da4a365-q29",
      "number": 29,
      "question": "A coin is tossed 5 times one after the other. Find the probability of getting at least 2 heads? एक सिक्के को एक के बाद एक 5 बार उछाला जाता है। कम से कम 2 चित आने की प्रायिकता ज्ञात कीजिए।",
      "questionHtml": "<p>A coin is tossed 5 times one after the other. Find the probability of getting at least 2 heads?<br/>एक सिक्के को एक के बाद एक 5 बार उछाला जाता है। कम से कम 2 चित आने की प्रायिकता ज्ञात कीजिए।</p>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "¼",
          "html": "<p>¼</p>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "13/16",
          "html": "<p>13/16</p>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "½",
          "html": "<p>½</p>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "1/5",
          "html": "<p>1/5</p>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p>Total outcomes = 25 = 32<br/>Not favourable outcomes <br/>(a) All tails:- 1 (TTTT)<br/>(b) 1 tail:- 5C1 = 5<br/>Favourable outcomes = 32- (1+5) = 26<br/>Probability = 26/32 = 13/16</p>",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "72516da4a365-q30",
      "number": 30,
      "question": "One ball is picked up randomly from a bag containing 8 yellow, 7 blue and 6 black balls. What is the probability that it is neither yellow nor black? 8 पीली, 7 नीली और 6 काली गेंदों वाले बैग से एक गेंद यादृच्छया निकाली जाती है। इसकी क्या प्रायिकता है कि यह न तो पीला है और न ही काला है?",
      "questionHtml": "<p>One ball is picked up randomly from a bag containing 8 yellow, 7 blue and 6 black balls. What is the probability that it is neither yellow nor black? <br/>8 पीली, 7 नीली और 6 काली गेंदों वाले बैग से एक गेंद यादृच्छया निकाली जाती है। इसकी क्या प्रायिकता है कि यह न तो पीला है और न ही काला है? </p>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "3/4",
          "html": "<p>3/4</p>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "4/7",
          "html": "<p>4/7</p>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "2/9",
          "html": "<p>2/9</p>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "1/3",
          "html": "<p>1/3</p>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "4",
      "solution": "<p>Probability = 7/(8+7+6) = 1/3</p>",
